# Live credentials for the smoke suite and the live validation (copy to .env -
# gitignored - and fill in). `make smoke`, `make smoke-live`,
# `make smoke-read-only`, `make smoke-cleanup` and `make validate-live` source
# .env when present. `make all` needs none of this.

# An account token or a workspace token (Railway -> Account settings ->
# Tokens, https://railway.com/account/tokens). Sent as `Authorization: Bearer`.
# This is the variable the Terraform provider reads. Note the Railway CLI uses
# the same name for a PROJECT token (sent in a different header); a project
# token does not work here.
RAILWAY_TOKEN=

# Optional: the workspace the smoke project is created in. Defaults to the
# first workspace the token can reach.
# RAILWAY_SMOKE_WORKSPACE_ID=
